{
  "comment": [
    "This program's own native-image metadata: the entry point the launcher reaches by JNI, the JDK's locale and",
    "time-zone data a native run was seen to read, the suite icons it reads from the class path, and the kernel32",
    "downcalls pty/ConPty makes (CreatePipe, CreatePseudoConsole, ResizePseudoConsole, ClosePseudoConsole, the",
    "process-thread attribute list, CreateProcessW, ReadFile, WriteFile, CloseHandle, WaitForSingleObject,",
    "GetExitCodeProcess, TerminateProcess, SetConsoleCtrlHandler), by shape. Everything else registers itself: the",
    "libraries carry their own (Win32, tactroller, DXGI, the shaders, the font atlas, imagelib), and the processor",
    "writes the icon's. Add to it when a native run of this program fails on something the JVM run did not: run the",
    "debug edition on a JVM under -agentlib:native-image-agent and keep only the entries naming this program."
  ],
